      "path": "main.cpp",
      "text": "void configure(\n    int width,\n    int height,\n    bool fullscreen\n);\n\nint compute(int a, int b, int c);\n\nvoid demo() {\n    int values[] = {\n        1,\n        2,\n        3\n    };\n\n    int result = compute(\n        values[0],\n        values[1],\n        values[2]\n    );\n\n    auto sum = [\n        first = values[0],\n        second = values[1]\n    ] {\n        return first + second;\n    };\n\n    auto scale = [](\n        int base,\n        int factor\n    ) {\n        return base * factor;\n    };\n\n    result += sum() + scale(result, 2);\n}\n\nint accumulate(\n    int start,\n    int step,\n    int count\n) {\n    return start + step * count;\n}\n\nvoid log_all(\n    const char* format,\n    ...\n);\n\nstruct Rect {\n    Rect(int w, int h);\n};\n\nRect area(\n    10,\n    20\n);\n\nRect brace_area{\n    30,\n    40\n};\n",
